warning[absurd_comparison]: `i >= 0` is always `true`
  --> tests/lint/absurd_comparison/bad.jai:5:11
   |
 5 |     while i >= 0 {
   |           ^^^^^^
   |
   = help: `u32` is unsigned and holds nothing below 0; compare with a signed value, or drop the check
   = note: `absurd_comparison` is `warn` by default

